{"steam_appid":1554650,"steam_name":"DROS","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1554650/589359/3141f94f6e15e6cf31884e436bd68124f1cd379d/1751002529/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1709637632","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256959230/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1709637632","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554650/ss_6b78a9a1aa465563d4ea0c3a9b57de737808ee91.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776260516","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554650/ss_392fe6153651a7a8efde050e8e672e2cdda90584.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776260516","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554650/ss_bab57955c6a31808fd4fb30759debf9c88b6043f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776260516","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554650/ss_74279458be512e4fd878c9f7bbf87e0136aab399.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776260516","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554650/ss_2f04d374afa7f81e80e732c7a24508f507cc9146.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776260516"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dros is a body-swapping puzzle adventure where you swap between two unlikely heroes: a small, gooey creature… and her human bounty hunter shell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They couldn’t be more different, but if they want to escape the Alchemy Tower, they’ll have to work as one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a twisted world where every corner hides a secret. Meet strange inhabitants, collect powerful alchemical treasures, and uncover the truth behind a place where nothing is quite what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554650/extras/da0decaba340cb2b8f9ab93ba9a6f973.webp?t=1776260516\" width=568 height=24 /></span> You'll need to body swap! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip through tight spaces, sneak past danger, and outsmart enemies as Little Dros. Use strength, weight, and brute force as Captain to reshape the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554650/extras/fce65c56d853e9a65763a5d4de7ba5e5.poster.avif?t=1776260516\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554650/extras/fce65c56d853e9a65763a5d4de7ba5e5.webm?t=1776260516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554650/extras/fce65c56d853e9a65763a5d4de7ba5e5.mp4?t=1776260516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554650/extras/399723c4c0e7aa0232d97faa62773f3a.webp?t=1776260516\" width=602 height=24 /></span> Talk to a cast of odd, memorable characters. Humans and Dros coexist here… but morality is murky, and everyone has something to hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554650/extras/ea0cd6ee4503f7d8f70dbd82879fc62f.poster.avif?t=1776260516\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554650/extras/ea0cd6ee4503f7d8f70dbd82879fc62f.webm?t=1776260516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554650/extras/ea0cd6ee4503f7d8f70dbd82879fc62f.mp4?t=1776260516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554650/extras/cb37ca2b3f85dea043a4a3b2e8a4d94c.webp?t=1776260516\" width=382 height=24 /></span>Solve puzzles, fight off unsettling creatures, and piece together the Tower’s many stories. You’ll need both brains and brawn to make it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554650/extras/bb4c6aec4261715f5e7dab424d66ee18.poster.avif?t=1776260516\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554650/extras/bb4c6aec4261715f5e7dab424d66ee18.webm?t=1776260516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1554650/extras/bb4c6aec4261715f5e7dab424d66ee18.mp4?t=1776260516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted Tower</strong> – Dense, detailed, and full of secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soundtrack by Arovane</strong> – Atmospheric and woven into every moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40 unique levels</strong> – No repeats. New mechanics, enemies, and surprises every time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Body swapping</strong> – Instantly switch between Captain and Little Dros.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two playstyles</strong> – Strength vs stealth. Brawn vs squirm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock abilities</strong> – Collect Prima and expand how you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strange characters</strong> – Weird, memorable, worth talking to.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story with bite</strong> – Humour, heart, and something darker underneath.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> – Find diary entries. Change the outcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Post-game challenges</strong> – More to master after the escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun-ready</strong> – Tight design. Hidden routes. Go fast.</p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 Quad-Core, 2.7 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 660 or AMD R7 260x<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX 10 compatible</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 Quad-Core, 3 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1080 Ti / RX Vega 64<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX 10 compatible</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Casual","Indie"],"developers":["emergeWorlds"],"publishers":["emergeWorlds"],"release_date":"20 Jul, 2023"}